      "transcriber_notes": [
        "List runs from p. 705 onto p. 706 (leaf p1077).",
        "Row 'Hsia Hsün-me', col 'Chinese': characters 1-2 read 夏循; the third character (土 radical with a 直/自-like right side) cannot be read with confidence — cell left blank.",
        "Row 'Mou Wei-t'ung', col 'Chinese': characters 1-2 read 牟維; the third character (water radical, right side unclear, possibly 潼/湆) cannot be read with confidence — cell left blank.",
        "Yin K'eng-ho: third character read as 稷 (does not match romanization 'ho'); Chu Teh-hsing: third character read as 馨 (bottom cramped).",
        "'Alamatu': the t is broken in print ('Alama:u'); 'Harbarovsk' and 'Blagovestchensk' spelt thus in the source.",
        "Hsü Hsiung-chang's position printed 'Consul-General' without period."
